{"availability":"available","full":"houtaroudes/houtaroudes-portfolio","name":"houtaroudes-portfolio","description":"I created my first version of my portfolio","category":"Design","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-24T18:27:49Z","updated":"2026-10-11T05:39:54Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://houtaroudes-portfolio.vercel.app","topics":["portfolio-website"],"demo":"https://houtaroudes-portfolio.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:11.630Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:11.630Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:11.630Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T06:15:11.630Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Full-stack developer portfolio with a retro pixel-art theme. Built with React, Vite, and hand-crafted pixel icons.","This is my first full version of my personal developer portfolio - a single-page React app with a retro-arcade visual language: pixel-style icons, glowing accent colors, animated particle backgrounds, scroll-reveal sections, and a typewriter hero intro. It showcases my projects in a filterable \"Project Catalog,\" lists my tools as an \"Equipment Loadout,\" and ends with a contact section, all wrapped in a dark/light theme toggle."],"features":["Hand-crafted pixel SVG icons for every section - stars, diamonds, bolts, trophies, and more. Each icon is built from raw coordinate data with no external dependencies.","Toggle between dark (void) and light themes. Preference persists via localStorage.","Hero statistics (projects, technologies, exercises) animate from 0 to their target values on scroll using requestAnimationFrame with ease-out timing.","Sections animate in as you scroll - supporting up, left, right, scale, and fade variants with staggered child animations.","The navigation bar automatically highlights the current section based on scroll position using IntersectionObserver."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/houtaroudes/houtaroudes-portfolio/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d7ed058a84190a7711d54d67f69cd7eed82760338aa84d271179f92678599bf4","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:11.742Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:11.742Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Full-stack developer portfolio with a retro pixel-art theme. Built with React, Vite, and hand-crafted pixel icons.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/houtaroudes/houtaroudes-portfolio/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"d7ed058a84190a7711d54d67f69cd7eed82760338aa84d271179f92678599bf4","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/houtaroudes/houtaroudes-portfolio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:11.743Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T05:39:54Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/houtaroudes/houtaroudes-portfolio/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T06:15:11.743Z","hash":"d7ed058a84190a7711d54d67f69cd7eed82760338aa84d271179f92678599bf4","originalBytes":6194,"storedBytes":6194,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["pixel","react","project","build","npm","vite","animated","icons","portfolio","run","bash","dev","icon","projects","scroll","built","clone","dark","developer","hand-crafted","hero","hub","install","light","animations","art","canvas","catalog","custom","dependencies","full","git","intersectionobserver","learning","production","section","sections","server","site","stack","svg","system","theme","typewriter","using","accents","animate","animation","app","background","backgrounds","body","bryan","cafe","close","colors","contact","each","ease-out","equipment","exercises","featured","features","filipino","filterable","framework","full-stack","getting","grid","homes","houtarou","houtaroudes-portfolio","houtaroudes-portfolio.vercel.app","language","layout","live","loadout","modal","modern","motion","mountain","mysql","particle","php","pixel-art","pixelpodweb","preview","rain","repo","repos","retro","retro-arcade"